cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this material, please cite it as below."
title: "NLP Modelling: nonlinear programming models with Python and Gurobi"
abstract: >-
  Complete teaching material for NLP Modelling: online lecture notes,
  Python/Gurobi code and case studies. Fourteen chapters: convexity, QP and KKT
  conditions, nonlinear solvers, eight nonlinear deterministic models (including
  the quadratic variants of production and EV charging), SVM and least-squares
  regression. Every model uses continuous variables only and a single solver.
